ignite-success = You ignite a small flame in your mouth.
ignite-no-fuel = You need to drink welding fuel first.
ignite-no-hands = You don't have any free hands.

tailwhip-success = You lash out with your tail!
tailwhip-no-targets = You whip your tail through empty air.
tailwhip-stamina-fail = Rest before tail lashing again!
tailwhip-restrained-fail = You need freedom of movement to tail lash!
tailwhip-momentum-fail = You run out of momentum!
tailwhip-hit-self = You hit { $target } with your tail!
tailwhip-hit-others = { $user } smacks { $target } with their tail!
tailwhip-balance-self = You lose your balance!
tailwhip-balance-others = { $user } loses their balance!
